{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1014351-imbued-items-non-awakened-paradox-1e-question","id":1014351,"title":"Imbued items + non-awakened + paradox 1e question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-08T10:07:44-08:00","id":1014351,"title":"Imbued items + non-awakened + paradox 1e question","content":"If my changeling uses an imbued item and triggers a paradox with that item, how are wisdom-based checks related to paradox resolved (since only Awakened have a Wisdom score)? Has this been addressed anywhere?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12390-gadren","name":"gadren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T10:56:04-08:00","id":1014378,"title":"","content":"It seems fairly obvious that if it's a relinquished item then no one makes a Wisdom related check.. Your Changeling might have to deal with Clarity depending on the circumstances, but that won't be for the same reason that a Mage would check Wisdom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T12:33:49-08:00","id":1014413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1014351-imbued-items-non-awakened-paradox-1e-question?p=1014378#post1014378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It seems fairly obvious that if it's a relinquished item then no one makes a Wisdom related check.. Your Changeling might have to deal with Clarity depending on the circumstances, but that won't be for the same reason that a Mage would check Wisdom.</div> </div> </div> </div>The imbued item merit says that if a non awakened uses an imbued item they can still cause a paradox (depending on the spell activated and circumstance). If for example, the paradox is a bedlam, then the duration is supposed to be determined by wisdom, which is why I ask how that is handled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12390,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12390-gadren","user":"gadren","date":". 12-08-2016, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12390-gadren","name":"gadren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T12:43:01-08:00","id":1014423,"title":"","content":"I don't think it's ever been stated anywhere. I would just use the Clarity rating, that seems simplest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T13:27:14-08:00","id":1014439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1014351-imbued-items-non-awakened-paradox-1e-question?p=1014423#post1014423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think it's ever been stated anywhere. I would just use the Clarity rating, that seems simplest.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I thought that was the case, but figured I'd double check. I don't suppose 2e addressed this issue either?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12390-gadren","name":"gadren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T17:03:43-08:00","id":1014521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gadren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1014351-imbued-items-non-awakened-paradox-1e-question?p=1014413#post1014413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The imbued item merit says that if a non awakened uses an imbued item they can still cause a paradox (depending on the spell activated and circumstance). If for example, the paradox is a bedlam, then the duration is supposed to be determined by wisdom, which is why I ask how that is handled.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could also just ballpark the Wisdom of the Mage who created it. As long as that remains consistent it won't be a problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T03:54:02-08:00","id":1014686,"title":"","content":"Use the Wisdom of the Mage from the time of Creation, I think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9312-myradmir","name":"Myradmir","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}